-- home/.home/autolink/common/zshrc --
export A=1
-- inbox-before.stdout --
homebot · testhost · 6 things need you (2 urgent)

  1  ! gitleaks is missing, so every commit is refused
       → brew install gitleaks
  2  ! The commit guard is not installed
       → homebot setup
  3  • 1 link to make or fix
       → homebot link
  4  • Not backed up yet: nothing pushed to the remote
       $WORK/remote.git
       → homebot remote
  5  • Profile workstation was never unpacked here
       It runs every step without asking; to see them first: homebot unpack
       --dry-run
       → homebot unpack
  ...and 1 more: homebot --all
